# Cloudflare Pages reads this file: how long a visitor's browser may keep a
# file before asking for it again. Without it, every file is re-checked on
# every visit.
#
# HTML, CSS and JS are left out on purpose: they change with every edit, so
# they keep the default (always check for a newer version).
# Images and the video are kept for a day, so a replaced photo shows up for
# returning visitors by the next day at the latest. The fonts never change.

# Every page: no content-type guessing, no leaking of the full address to other
# sites, no embedding of the site in someone else's frame, and the browser
# features this site never uses switched off. The Content-Security-Policy is
# deliberately limited to the directives that cannot break the reviews widget.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; form-action 'self'

/assets/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/brand/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/assets/gallery/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/assets/studio/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
